{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vgz75okA5o1794794789.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一餐熱飯傳遞人間溫情，在貴州貴陽有義工在醫院外，經常為病患和家屬送上免費午餐，與他們閒聊、打打氣。</p><p></p><p>穿紅色背心的義工這日近午飯時間，來到貴陽的貴州省人民醫院門前，準備為已排隊的醫院病人及家屬提供免費愛心午餐。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.GZ.KITCHEN.1029-1116_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rUmDmUP6gZ1794794765.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>貴陽「愛心廚房」負責人翟饒表示：「因為這邊針對於的是大病的病人，比如說癌症、白血病、腎衰竭。愛心餐一頓飯微不足道，實際上現在病人最需要的是甚麼？關心關懷。好多放療、化療的一個人，在這裡孤孤單單的，我們想的就說給他聊兩句天，給他加下油、打下氣，心態好，一切都會好。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.GZ.KITCHEN.1029-1116_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ndtNKtCQPY1794794778.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他最初同朋友逢周一至五各自在家，將煮好的湯及菜帶來送給有需要的人，之後見越來越多人有需要，就索性在醫院附近租舖，一次過做百多人的飯菜。有病人家屬也加入幫忙，將愛心傳開去。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:11:15.263240+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T02:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T14:32:31.419365+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T03:04:40.628315+00:00","content_hash":"a34bb28a8ea6f8ce975a094b8f978a271291a148ae02350971a5e2559c7e64b4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:11:15.263240+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}